      "item_id": "Example_07_03_03",
      "kind": "example",
      "title": "Example 3",
      "position": 4,
      "nearest_heading": "Using Double-Angle Formulas to Verify Identities",
      "prompt_text": "Using the Double-Angle Formulas to Establish an Identity Establish the following identity using double-angle formulas: $1 + sin \\left(\\right. 2 \\theta \\left.\\right) = \\left(\\right. sin \\theta + cos \\theta \\left.\\right)^{2}$",
      "prompt_latex_bits": [
        "1 + sin \\left(\\right. 2 \\theta \\left.\\right) = \\left(\\right. sin \\theta + cos \\theta \\left.\\right)^{2}",
        "\\left(\\right. a \\pm b \\left.\\right)^{2} = a^{2} \\pm 2 a b + b^{2}",
        "a = sin \\theta",
        "b = cos \\theta ."
      ],
      "has_solution": true,
      "source_anchor": "Example_07_03_03",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "item_id": "ti_07_03_02",
